OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fisolated initially, building overnight
OL,7,Fand wintry at times at low levels.
OL,8,FClear spells and light winds, bringing
OL,9,Fa frosty start to week for many away
OL,10,Ffrom northern coastal fringes.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FShowers across most areas,
OL,13,Fthese most frequent during the morning
OL,14,Fand over northern areas and
OL,15,Foccasionally turning wintry.
OL,16,FTemperatures seasonally low given the
OL,17,Fgenerally northerly breezes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
