OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FTuesday brings periods of rain and
OL,7,Fhill snow, which turns heavy at times.
OL,8,FWednesday rather cloudy with some
OL,9,Fpatchy rain.Thursday frosty, dry and
OL,10,Fbright in south, with showers in north.
